  "edits": [
    {
      "qid": 4,
      "field": "content",
      "beforeSha256": "ecb594d7e1e1de61fcbde6f10fd378a007d10fb0364f1f4ff26400bcaf787f71",
      "afterSha256": "1ffedb96a5baff016baed696f7e3f22e8f301604b604041a9f3e25574a641e7b",
      "oldLiteral": "\"두 상수 $a$, $b$에 대하여 $72^circ=a\\\\pi$, $b^circ=\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{12}$일 때, $ab$의 값은? [3.6점]\"",
      "newLiteral": "\"두 상수 $a$, $b$에 대하여 $72^\\\\circ=a\\\\pi$, $b^\\\\circ=\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{12}$일 때, $ab$의 값은? [3.6점]\""
    },
    {
      "qid": 4,
      "field": "solution",
      "beforeSha256": "bff7b9e63b8914eea7b53a6fe4d0cf1f48b1ebe151c18d854e38942a9107cd54",
      "afterSha256": "7aa48f7c7e4a425379d4afd1e2ec8794561b27e789b4880511fb7197edbc57a1",
      "oldLiteral": "\"도 단위를 라디안으로 바꾸어 $a$를 구한다.\\n$72^circ=72\\\\times\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{180}=\\\\frac{2\\\\pi}{5}$이므로\\n$a=\\\\frac25$이다.\\n또\\n$b^circ=b\\\\times\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{180}=\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{12}$이므로\\n$b=15$이다.\\n따라서\\n$ab=\\\\frac25\\\\times15=6$이다.\\n\\n그러므로 정답은 ②이다.\"",
      "newLiteral": "\"도 단위를 라디안으로 바꾸어 $a$를 구한다.\\n$72^\\\\circ=72\\\\times\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{180}=\\\\frac{2\\\\pi}{5}$이므로\\n$a=\\\\frac25$이다.\\n또\\n$b^\\\\circ=b\\\\times\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{180}=\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{12}$이므로\\n$b=15$이다.\\n따라서\\n$ab=\\\\frac25\\\\times15=6$이다.\\n\\n그러므로 정답은 ②이다.\""
    },
    {
      "qid": 10,
      "field": "content",
      "beforeSha256": "9323e981aa5bfc22296726fee50d1f2e9c4b8ff5091ab88d6c2b9d3af6487db1",
      "afterSha256": "6008fbcb61e8e4b47dbb8ad948a6d235b20ba2278b3dc3c6706899f7511d84c1",
      "oldLiteral": "\"$\\\\sin\\\\heta+\\\\cos\\\\heta=\\\\sqrt2$일 때, $\\\\sin\\\\heta-\\\\cos\\\\heta$의 값은? [4.2점]\"",
      "newLiteral": "\"$\\\\sin\\\\theta+\\\\cos\\\\theta=\\\\sqrt2$일 때, $\\\\sin\\\\theta-\\\\cos\\\\theta$의 값은? [4.2점]\""
    },
    {
      "qid": 10,
      "field": "solution",
      "beforeSha256": "6a1d6bb86381261f1670b40fb8afbffc14a79f1e6eff68754b1029f57b679565",
      "afterSha256": "a80628440166cf3c041cd3247e110b8391f0f6ccb6641cf23664e12fc6da1a7c",
      "oldLiteral": "\"주어진 식을 제곱하면\\n$\\\\sin^2\\\\heta+2\\\\sin\\\\heta\\\\cos\\\\heta+\\\\cos^2\\\\heta=2$\\n$1+2\\\\sin\\\\heta\\\\cos\\\\heta=2$\\n따라서 $2\\\\sin\\\\heta\\\\cos\\\\heta=1$이다.\\n그러면\\n$(\\\\sin\\\\heta-\\\\cos\\\\heta)^2=\\\\sin^2\\\\heta-2\\\\sin\\\\heta\\\\cos\\\\heta+\\\\cos^2\\\\heta=1-1=0$\\n따라서 $\\\\sin\\\\heta-\\\\cos\\\\heta=0$이다.\\n\\n그러므로 정답은 ③이다.\"",
      "newLiteral": "\"주어진 식을 제곱하면\\n$\\\\sin^2\\\\theta+2\\\\sin\\\\theta\\\\cos\\\\theta+\\\\cos^2\\\\theta=2$\\n$1+2\\\\sin\\\\theta\\\\cos\\\\theta=2$\\n따라서 $2\\\\sin\\\\theta\\\\cos\\\\theta=1$이다.\\n그러면\\n$(\\\\sin\\\\theta-\\\\cos\\\\theta)^2=\\\\sin^2\\\\theta-2\\\\sin\\\\theta\\\\cos\\\\theta+\\\\cos^2\\\\theta=1-1=0$\\n따라서 $\\\\sin\\\\theta-\\\\cos\\\\theta=0$이다.\\n\\n그러므로 정답은 ③이다.\""
    },
    {
      "qid": 18,
      "field": "content",
      "beforeSha256": "a66e59ed3befadfdf6bf274c695cd8e3e3c85aa453e6a9c5e74dd6c2aedea5d2",
      "afterSha256": "a5715733a206def1a6d88a7d7269fd40dc459b00f92b1ca117525fd837ea1411",
      "oldLiteral": "\"다음을 만족시키는 각 $\\\\heta$는 제 몇 사분면의 각인지 쓰시오.<br>$\\\\sin\\\\heta>0$, $\\\\an\\\\heta<0$ [3점]\"",
      "newLiteral": "\"다음을 만족시키는 각 $\\\\theta$는 제 몇 사분면의 각인지 쓰시오.<br>$\\\\sin\\\\theta>0$, $\\\\tan\\\\theta<0$ [3점]\""
    },
    {
      "qid": 18,
      "field": "solution",
      "beforeSha256": "b04e40c6f2be506fbddfd02ea5de7d19e7bb852b8e535b8cfdddb6768bb43a5b",
      "afterSha256": "00a8ce68887d3f991089ae5ac312b161ff55cd660c29cc8a9b8cbdc61932a1ed",
      "oldLiteral": "\"$\\\\sin\\\\heta>0$이면 $\\\\heta$는 제1사분면 또는 제2사분면에 있다.\\n$\\\\an\\\\heta<0$이면 $\\\\sin\\\\heta$와 $\\\\cos\\\\heta$의 부호가 서로 다르다.\\n이미 $\\\\sin\\\\heta>0$이므로 $\\\\cos\\\\heta<0$이다.\\n따라서 $\\\\heta$는 제2사분면의 각이다.\"",
      "newLiteral": "\"$\\\\sin\\\\theta>0$이면 $\\\\theta$는 제1사분면 또는 제2사분면에 있다.\\n$\\\\tan\\\\theta<0$이면 $\\\\sin\\\\theta$와 $\\\\cos\\\\theta$의 부호가 서로 다르다.\\n이미 $\\\\sin\\\\theta>0$이므로 $\\\\cos\\\\theta<0$이다.\\n따라서 $\\\\theta$는 제2사분면의 각이다.\""
    }
  ],
